 "caveats": [
  "Backtested 2011-2026 on the BROAD universe (no floor; trading = eligible), NOT a forward projection. Realistic forward ~25-29%; per-2yr regime CAGR 13% to 45% (median 31%).",
  "E3/PEAD is the validated core: real post-earnings drift (survives zeroing announcement-window days), entered 3 days AFTER the filing \u2014 reacts to earnings, does not predict them.",
  "Liquidity-survival 0.96 at a $5M-ADV lens \u2014 the edge is tradeable, not a microcap artifact (unlike the .7-event tilt it replaced).",
  "TRUE daily mark-to-market: the -41% drawdown is the real intra-period low. Top-3 concentration = high single-name risk (201 distinct names rotated over the backtest).",
  "Frictionless backtest: ignores ~783%/yr turnover cost, slippage, tax. LIVE forward paper-track (separate, vs SPY) begins 2026-07-01."
 ]
